{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113140","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113140/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113140/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113140/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113140","id":3661355254,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc61VGq3","number":113140,"title":"Fix AnimationMixer error spam by respecting cache validity on invalid `root_node`","user":{"login":"LanzaSchneider","id":24624901,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjI0OTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24624901?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider","html_url":"https://github.com/LanzaSchneider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-11-25T03:23:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T00:13:11Z","closed_at":"2025-11-26T22:49:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113140","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113140","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113140.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113140.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-26T22:49:25Z"},"body":"### Description\r\n\r\nWhen an AnimationMixer has an invalid root_node path assigned, attempting to play an animation causes the engine to spam the console with \"No animation in cache\" errors on every frame. This makes debugging extremely difficult and obscures real issues.\r\n\r\nFor example:\r\n```\r\nextends Node3D\r\n\r\n@export_node_path(\"AnimationPlayer\")\r\nvar path_to_animation_player: NodePath\r\n@export\r\nvar animation_library: AnimationLibrary\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar animation_player: AnimationPlayer = get_node(path_to_animation_player)\r\n\tvar library_name := 'test'\r\n\tanimation_player.add_animation_library(library_name, animation_library)\r\n\tanimation_player.root_node = NodePath('2025/11/25')\r\n\tanimation_player.play('%s/%s' % [library_name, animation_library.get_animation_list()[0]])\r\n```\r\n\r\nit gives `No animation in cache` errors on every frame:\r\n<img width=\"499\" height=\"248\" alt=\"p1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc1bbd5e-3f90-443a-b2ee-ee4c45346e42\" />\r\n\r\n### Root Cause\r\n\r\nThe `_update_caches()` method correctly detects an invalid `root_node` and sets `cache_valid = false`. However, `_blend_pre_process()` was returning `true`, which allowed `_process_animation()` to continue executing the entire blending pipeline (`_blend_calc_total_weight()`, `_blend_process()`, etc.). These downstream functions then fail due to missing caches and spam errors repeatedly.\r\n\r\n### Proposed Solution\r\n\r\n* Changed the return value of `_blend_pre_process()` from `true` to `cache_valid`. This ensures that if caches are not built (due to invalid `root_node` or other reasons), the entire blending process is skipped immediately.\r\n* Enhanced the warning in `_update_caches()` to be more descriptive and use `WARN_PRINT_ONCE`, providing developers with an immediate, actionable message instead of vague downstream errors.\r\n\r\nAfter these changes, it gives:\r\n<img width=\"902\" height=\"56\" alt=\"{5A4D21D3-E0AE-4CC7-B7ED-286FC398A538}\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16685071-463d-4afe-ad0f-2327b119f227\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113140/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113140/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}